# Setup: MIDI channel 2 hears channel 2 only; Omni hears all; transpose and tune move the pitch
wait 200
tap GLO
spin K3 2
expect par28 2
midi 90 3C 64
wait 20
expect gate 0
midi 91 3C 64
wait 20
expect gate 1
midi 81 3C 00
wait 20
expect gate 0
spin K3 -2
expect par28 0
spin K1 12
spin K2 -50
midi 93 3C 64
wait 20
expect note 7150
midi 83 3C 00
wait 100
